				"description": "<p><strong>2 Actions, Costs 1 Toolbelt scrap, Range: 12. The turret is destroyed afterwards.</strong> Fire <strong>INT times</strong>, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 1 of the Engineer's Toolbelt scraps (chat card with Undo) and asks before destroying the turret afterwards.</em></p><p><em>[A] Fires INT times (the Engineer's INT): after the first shot resolves, the attack dialog opens again for each remaining shot (pick a target each time; cancel one to stop the volley). Each shot is its own attack roll that can hit, miss or crit, and Overclocked applies to each. The scrap is spent and the turret removed only after the last shot.</em></p>",
